msgid "Package management"
msgstr "Gestion des paquets"

#: ../../reference/packages.rst:7
msgid "Installing packages with ``mip``"
msgstr "Installation de paquets avec ``mip``"

#: ../../reference/packages.rst:9
msgid ""
"Network-capable boards include the ``mip`` module, which can install "
"packages from :term:`micropython-lib` and from third-party sites (including "
"GitHub, GitLab)."
msgstr ""
"Les cartes dotées de capacités réseau incluent le module ``mip``, qui peut "
"installer des paquets depuis :term:`micropython-lib` et depuis des sites "
"tiers (y compris GitHub, GitLab)."

#: ../../reference/packages.rst:12
msgid ""
"``mip`` (\"mip installs packages\") is similar in concept to Python's "
"``pip`` tool, however it does not use the PyPI index, rather it uses "
":term:`micropython-lib` as its index by default. ``mip`` will automatically "
"fetch compiled :term:`.mpy file` when downloading from micropython-lib."
msgstr ""
"``mip`` (\"mip installs packages\") est similaire dans son concept à l'outil"
" ``pip`` de Python, mais il n'utilise pas l'index PyPI ; il utilise plutôt "
":term:`micropython-lib` comme index par défaut. ``mip`` récupérera "
"automatiquement le :term:`.mpy file` compilé lors du téléchargement depuis "
"micropython-lib."

